<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>Entrando no Lobby</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100dvh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1f3b5b, #08101c 72%);
            color: #edf4ff;
            font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
        }
        .panel {
            width: min(92vw, 420px);
            padding: 24px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.3);
            background: rgba(6, 12, 24, 0.82);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
            text-align: center;
        }
        h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.6rem; }
        p { margin: 0; color: #d7e6fb; }
    </style>
    <script>
        (function () {
            const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
            const userId = params.get('userId') || '';
            const url = userId
                ? `/city?from=lobby&userId=${encodeURIComponent(userId)}`
                : '/';
            window.location.replace(url);
        })();
    </script>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="panel">
        <h1>Entrando no Lobby</h1>
        <p>Preparando a sala de espera e o ponto de encontro dos jogadores.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>